dCompass Q4 Budget request 
This proposal offers integration of dCompass to the Decentralized Gitcoin Workstream also known as dGitcoin.

Snapshot proposal: https://snapshot.org/#/gitcoindao.eth/proposal/0x230bcb7d3548048fc94e5745f7934d80bfc357632af1038cb0941fc54fbae021

Address of the Gnosis Safe Multisig: 0x756239E5B7D2aa6F3DA0594B296952121Fb71606

Amount in GTC: 26145 for Q4

We'll add more people as we go, like active contributors and thought leaders. Keeping diversity within this group is important to represent the different point of views. We currently have a 3/5 set up, ideally we would increase the threshold to 67% as we add more people.

